        <item>
            <title>1.5.4</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:03:10 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20261009.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h4>Fixed</h4>
<ul>
<li>Email Preview keeps its heading on a separate row from preview tools, giving the controls the full available width at narrower window sizes.</li>
<li>The widget now uses a Team ID-prefixed App Group so macOS allows it to load its descriptor and appear in the Widget Gallery.</li>
<li>The release package now includes extracted App Intents metadata, allowing Shortcuts to discover Jetstream&#x27;s App Shortcuts.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
